body:
@aymeric-giraudet Thank you for the package! Very helpful to inspect the route as a drop in replacement for [uiState](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/use-instantsearch/react-hooks/#widget-param-uistate) which IME is unreliable (see [here](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch/discussions/5353#discussioncomment-4335940)).

I've noticed that `windowTitle` doesn't seem to work. It flashes the new title for a second and then reverts back to the old one.

I've provided custom routing functions:

```js
 routing: {
      router: createInstantSearchNextRouter({
        serverUrl,
        routerOptions: {
          windowTitle: (routeState) => windowTitle(routeState, facetConfig),
          createURL,
          parseURL,
        },
      }),
      stateMapping: {
        routeToState: (params) => routeToState(params, facetConfig),
        stateToRoute,
      },
    }
```
